  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/01/IMG_0091.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>En el Centro de Empleo y Cultura, en la calle Balmes de Onda, continuar&aacute; la tarde de este s&aacute;bado,&nbsp;de 16.30 a 20.30 horas, el&nbsp;marat&oacute;n solidario de donaci&oacute;n de sangre, muy concurrido por la ma&ntilde;ana.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratodonaciosangonda170115/img_0079.jpg\" alt=\"img_0079\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratodonaciosangonda170115/img_0082.jpg\" alt=\"img_0082\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratodonaciosangonda170115/img_0085.jpg\" alt=\"img_0085\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratodonaciosangonda170115/img_0087.jpg\" alt=\"img_0087\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratodonaciosangonda170115/img_0088.jpg\" alt=\"img_0088\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratodonaciosangonda170115/img_0089.jpg\" alt=\"img_0089\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratodonaciosangonda170115/img_0091.jpg\" alt=\"img_0091\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratodonaciosangonda170115/img_0093.jpg\" alt=\"img_0093\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratodonaciosangonda170115/img_0094.jpg\" alt=\"img_0094\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8